WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:08.351
Hi!

00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:09.226
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.273 --> 00:00:10.898
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:35.463
Do you know what to say when you 
want to keep a conversation going?

00:00:35.737 --> 00:00:40.004
Listen out for useful language for 
keeping a conversation going.

00:00:40.322 --> 00:00:43.166
 Then, we'll practise saying the 
new phrases –

00:00:43.221 --> 00:00:44.603
after this.

00:00:45.682 --> 00:00:46.470
Hi, Bob!

00:00:47.197 --> 00:00:48.986
Oh, morning, Noelia.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:08.976
So, what's new?

00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:11.453
New, hmm,

00:01:12.492 --> 00:01:14.061
let me think.

00:01:14.413 --> 00:01:17.678
Hmm … Nothing much.

00:01:18.085 --> 00:01:19.085
Oh, hang on.

00:01:19.632 --> 00:01:22.983
My dog Bertie had his 14th birthday 
on Monday!

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:24.943
Oh, he's getting old then?

00:01:24.993 --> 00:01:26.196
I guess so …

00:01:26.415 --> 00:01:28.547
but not as old as his owner.

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:29.758
Haha …

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.587
er, anyway …

00:01:37.614 --> 00:01:39.036
How about you, Noelia?

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:40.332
How's it going?

00:01:40.731 --> 00:01:42.348
Great, actually.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:45.387
Yeah … all good.

00:01:46.466 --> 00:01:47.340
By the way,

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:51.240
I wanted to ask you, where in 
Spain are you from?

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.887
I'm from Santander.

00:01:53.089 --> 00:01:54.651
Oh, lovely.

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:56.792
Wonderful to grow up near the sea.

00:01:56.862 --> 00:01:58.854
Yeah, it was perfect.

00:01:59.847 --> 00:02:01.346
Ah, I miss the sea.

00:02:01.364 --> 00:02:02.637
I know what you mean.

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:04.550
I used to live in Spain

00:02:05.107 --> 00:02:06.676
and I absolutely loved it.

00:02:06.958 --> 00:02:07.801
Really?

00:02:07.872 --> 00:02:09.130
I didn't know that, Bob!

00:02:09.153 --> 00:02:12.436
Yeah, I had a little bar on 
the Costa Brava.

00:02:12.718 --> 00:02:15.139
Wow! So do you speak Spanish then?

00:02:15.686 --> 00:02:18.202
Oh, not much.

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:20.970
Ah, those were the days!

00:02:22.436 --> 00:02:23.209
Excuse me.

00:02:27.865 --> 00:02:35.198
Perdona, Noelia. Tengo que irme. Me necesitan en el segundo piso. ¡Hasta pronto!

00:02:39.869 --> 00:02:40.595
Wow!

00:02:43.236 --> 00:02:44.236
Hello again!

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:47.204
Wow! Bob is full of surprises.

00:02:47.697 --> 00:02:52.764
So, did you notice the useful phrases 
used for keeping a conversation going?

00:02:53.427 --> 00:02:55.427
 Listen to me and then repeat.

00:02:55.919 --> 00:02:57.489
So, what's new?

00:03:00.591 --> 00:03:02.200
So, what's new?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.347
Let me think ...

00:03:09.124 --> 00:03:10.190
Let me think ...

00:03:12.772 --> 00:03:13.772
Nothing much.

00:03:16.741 --> 00:03:17.874
Nothing much.

00:03:20.562 --> 00:03:21.562
Anyway …

00:03:23.929 --> 00:03:24.929
Anyway …

00:03:26.795 --> 00:03:28.185
How about you, Noelia?

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.544
How about you, Noelia?

00:03:35.037 --> 00:03:36.154
How's it going?

00:03:38.926 --> 00:03:39.926
How's it going?

00:03:42.442 --> 00:03:44.775
By the way, I wanted to ask you ...

00:03:48.098 --> 00:03:50.621
By the way, I wanted to ask you ...

00:03:53.542 --> 00:03:54.792
I know what you mean.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.651
I know what you mean.

00:04:00.855 --> 00:04:03.300
Really? I didn't know that!

00:04:06.655 --> 00:04:08.866
Really? I didn't know that!

00:04:11.859 --> 00:04:17.757
Try and use some of these phrases the next time you want to keep a conversation going in English.

00:04:17.961 --> 00:04:19.359
Bye for now!

